  "description": "A self-contained DotEnv library for .NET 8, shaped after System.Text.Json and matching the sibling Bodu.Text.Toml surface: the forward-only ref-struct Utf8DotEnvReader/Utf8DotEnvWriter token surface over UTF-8, a mutable DotEnvNode DOM, a read-only DotEnvDocument DOM, and the DotEnvSerializer POCO mapper. DotEnv models a flat, ordered object of string-valued keys with export prefixes and comment trivia.",
